{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は収録だったんですが、\nたくさん笑いました(｡-∀-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとも会えて嬉しかったな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりからあんぱんをもらいました！\n美味しかったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織と約束したある場所に\nはやく行きたいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は楽屋が違ったけど\nはやく支度を終えて伊織のところに\n遊びに行ったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織にべったりです(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩、蘭世、私が公式サポーターを\nさせて頂いてる\nマドンナジャパンさんが\n3日から11日まで韓国・釜山で\n第7回 WBSC 女子野球ワールドカップの\n5連覇をかけて戦ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日行われた決起集会で\n公式サポーターの私たちに\n5連覇、優勝を\n持って帰ってくる！と言ってくださった\n皆さんを1日も忘れることなく\n応援してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝ち進んでいるマドンナジャパン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちもより一層力を込めて\n気持ちを込めて応援していきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんもマドンナジャパンさんを\n一緒に応援してください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいいな\n頑張ってる人ってかっこいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな素敵でかっこいい皆さんを\n応援させていただけて本当に嬉しく思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝ち進め！マドンナジャパン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、自分の中で\nいろんな事への気持ちや思いが\n足りてない気がする。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族を思うこととか\n友達、メンバーを思うこと\n支えてくれるスタッフさんやファンの方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前は余裕がなくて\n心も全開で動いてくれてなかったけど\nいまは全開で動いてるのに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと頑張らなきゃっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るとね、自分の中でこだわりが出てくるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのこだわりはいい方にも悪い方にも\n動くと思うんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、自分でそのこだわりが\nいい方にいくのか悪い方にいくのか\n分からないからどうしたらいいか分からない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、まだそのこだわりは\n持ってるの！自分の中に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっとこのこだわりを\n持ち続けて頑張ってみて\n違うな～と思ったら違うこだわりを\n見つけます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はストレートだったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/06/7328121/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたっ！"}],"source":"archive"}